            "id": 6668583,
            "title": "盤中速報 - 恆生科技指數下跌-136.94點至3512.2點，跌幅3.75%",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>截至台北時間20日10:04，恆生科技指數下跌136.94點（或3.75%），暫報3512.20點。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li>近 1 週：-7.19%</li><li>近 1 月：-11.18%</li><li>近 3 月：-22.06%</li><li>近 6 月：-24.88%</li><li>今年以來：-33.84%</li></ul></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>焦點個股</em></p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>林業及木材概念領跌-5.80%。其中    大森控股(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:01580:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/01580\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">01580-HK</a>)            下跌        13.21%            ;        鴻偉亞洲(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:08191:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/08191\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">08191-HK</a>)            下跌        10.34%            ;        浩盟控股(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:08186:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/08186\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">08186-HK</a>)            下跌        3.53%    。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>地產代理概念領跌-5.60%。其中    易居企業控股(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:02048:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/02048\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">02048-HK</a>)            下跌        7.41%            ;        美聯集團(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:01200:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/01200\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">01200-HK</a>)            下跌        5.41%            ;        方圓生活服務(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:09978:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/09978\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">09978-HK</a>)            下跌        3.98%    。</p></section></main>",
