            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>截至台北時間20日10:19，櫃買市場<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>下跌20.44點（或7.16%），暫報264.89點。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li>近 1 週：-15.01%</li><li>近 1 月：-27.59%</li><li>近 3 月：-25.85%</li><li>近 6 月：-28.34%</li><li>今年以來：+3.29%</li></ul></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>焦點個股</em></p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>測試介面概念領跌-9.65%。其中    旺矽(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6223:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6223\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6223-TW</a>)            下跌        9.99%            ;        雍智科技(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6683:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6683\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6683-TW</a>)            下跌        9.99%            ;        穎崴(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6515:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6515\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6515-TW</a>)            下跌        9.98%    。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>玻璃基板概念領跌-9.51%。其中    蔚華科(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3055:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3055\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3055-TW</a>)            下跌        10%            ;        鈦昇(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:8027:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/8027\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">8027-TW</a>)            下跌        10%            ;        友威科(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3580:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3580\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3580-TW</a>)            下跌        9.99%    。</p></section></main>",
