            "id": 6668576,
            "title": "盤中速報 - 恆生科技指數下跌-133.74點至3515.4點，跌幅3.66%",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>截至台北時間20日10:03，恆生科技指數下跌133.74點（或3.66%），暫報3515.40點。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li>近 1 週：-7.19%</li><li>近 1 月：-11.18%</li><li>近 3 月：-22.06%</li><li>近 6 月：-24.88%</li><li>今年以來：-33.84%</li></ul></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>焦點個股</em></p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>林業及木材概念領跌-6.12%。其中    大森控股(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:01580:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/01580\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">01580-HK</a>)            下跌        13.21%            ;        鴻偉亞洲(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:08191:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/08191\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">08191-HK</a>)            下跌        6.9%            ;        浩盟控股(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:08186:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/08186\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">08186-HK</a>)            下跌        3.53%    。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>出版概念領跌-5.32%。其中    超媒體控股(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:00072:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/00072\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">00072-HK</a>)            下跌        13.5%            ;        文化傳信(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:00343:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/00343\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">00343-HK</a>)            下跌        10.71%            ;        北青傳媒(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:01000:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/01000\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">01000-HK</a>)            下跌        8.7%    。</p></section></main>",
