            "title": "盤中速報 - 晨訊科-DR(912000)股價殺至跌停，跌停價2.02元，成交724張",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>晨訊科-DR(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:912000:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/912000\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">912000-TW</a>)20日10:23下跌0.22元，股價跌停報2.02元，委買49張、委賣1張，成交724張。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>主要業務為手機、解決方案及智能終端。無線通訊模塊。物聯網業務。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>晨訊科-DR(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:912000:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/912000\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">912000-TW</a>)近5日股價下跌5.08%，集中市場<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>下跌10.83%，股價漲幅表現優於大盤。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>近5日籌碼</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>三大法人合計買賣超：-31 張</li> <li>外資買賣超：-31 張</li> <li>投信買賣超：0 張</li> <li>自營商買賣超：0 張</li> <li>融資增減：-250 張</li> <li>融券增減：0 張</li> </ul></section></main>",
